### 0. Send Request for OTP Generation (Run This First!)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "1234567890",
  "email": "test@houseilla.in"
}

### 1. Authenticate & Extract JWT Secure Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "1234567890",
  "email": "test@houseilla.in", 
  "otpCode": "736572"
}

